      "purpose": "MetaModules use the common explicit composition model."
    }
  ],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Define MetaModule as a stable canonical feature/application composition identity distinct from its constituent modules, UI placement and concrete runtime instance.",
    "notes": [
      "Unlocked pending reconciliation against composition, nanoCMS, UserModule, Editor and runtime activation contracts."
    ]
  },
